-- MiniMax H3 Image: a text-to-image id priced per size (1K and 2K the same,
-- 4K more) and an edit id priced per size and per reference image (1 to 16).
--
-- Values MUST match STATIC_CREDIT_COSTS in backend/src/ee/billing/credits.ts
-- (generated by minimax-h3-image-pricing.ts) and the `pricing` rows on each
-- MODEL_CATALOG entry. The bare ids stand for 2K (and an edit's one reference
-- image); a run is always priced on a composite.
--
-- Per CLAUDE.md Provider Enum Sync step 9: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (preserves
-- admin overrides).

BEGIN;

ON CONFLICT (model_identifier) DO NOTHING;

COMMIT;
